[32m+[m[32mBook tutors and study rooms in seconds. Students search real-time availability, book instantly or request approval, message their tutor, reschedule, and get reminders. Tutors publish availability, approve requests and track their week.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Features[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Smart search**: keyword, subject, date, time, location, capacity, sort; pagination; Ctrl/⌘ + K command palette.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Race-safe booking**: database-level availability checks, atomic transactions and a unique active-booking constraint.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Approval workflow**: tutors can approve or decline each request; statuses Pending / Confirmed / Declined / Cancelled.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Rescheduling, cancellation, .ics calendar export** (with reminder alarm).[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Booking messages** between student and tutor.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Notifications**: in-app bell and email; `send_reminders` command for 24h reminders.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Tutor studio**: recurring weekly availability, request inbox, 7-week session chart, public profile.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Reviews and favourites**, verified by completed sessions.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Security**: login throttling, CSP, HSTS, secure cookies, CSRF, validated redirects, branded error pages.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Design**: dark (black / cobalt, lime touches) and light (beige / sage, burgundy touches) liquid-glass themes.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Run locally[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mpython -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate[m
[32m+[m[32mpip install -r requirements.txt[m
[32m+[m[32mpython manage.py migrate[m
[32m+[m[32mpython manage.py seed_demo          # optional sample data[m
[32m+[m[32mpython manage.py runserver[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mDemo logins (password `Demo12345!`): `student@example.test`, `tutor@example.test`, `alex@example.test` (approves each request). Create an admin with `python manage.py createsuperuser` (site at `/admin/`).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Production[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mcp .env.example .env     # set DJANGO_SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS, passwords[m
[32m+[m[32mdocker compose up -d --build[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mThis starts gunicorn + PostgreSQL + Redis and an hourly reminder worker. Without Docker: `pip install psycopg[binary] redis`, set the variables in `.env.example`, then `python manage.py collectstatic --noinput && python manage.py migrate && gunicorn studysync.wsgi -c gunicorn.conf.py`. Static files are served by WhiteNoise; `/healthz/` is the health probe. Verify with `DJANGO_DEBUG=0 python manage.py check --deploy`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Tests[m
[32m+[m[32m`python manage.py test` (39 tests).[m
